     2	# Replication Package for "_A Study on the Pythonic Functional Constructs' Understandability_" to appear at ICSE 2024
     3	
     4	- **Authors**: Cyrine Zid, Fiorella Zampetti, Giuliano Antoniol, Massimiliano Di penta
     5	- **Article Preprint:** [https://mdipenta.github.io/files/ICSE24_funcExperiment.pdf](https://mdipenta.github.io/files/ICSE24_funcExperiment.pdf)
     6	- **Artifacts:** [https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.8191782](https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.8191782)
